• The bearer has the following ability: ‘Wrath of Baal (Aura):
While a friendly BLOOD ANGELS JUMP PACK unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time that unit is selected to make a Normal Move, Advance or Fall Back, add 2&quot; to that unit&apos;s Move characteristic until the end of the phase.’</characteristic>
